  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "You came here because of a rumor.",
      "Egolranos will attack us in the future.",
      "Chaliar with live or death has been providing some ",
      "ways to resolve the problem. Get it, this is called",
      "a 'Chaliar's Tear' which is a seal of her with live",
      "or death. If you overcome my test, you must be used ",
      "the item as you want.",
      "",
      "My test is to hunt 10 grotesques.",
      "",
      "Please be careful! If you die, and the item will be ",
      "disappeared, and if you do that come to me again.",
      "I hope you succeed in the quest, and good luck with",
      "Caliar's Blessing."
    ]
  },
